  "id": "pluralistic-ignorance",
  "term": "pluralistic ignorance",
  "definition": "Pluralistic ignorance is the mistaken belief that your own attitude differs from what most other people believe. Because of this misperception, people may follow what they think others think or do, even when it does not match their own view.",
